---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../utils/site";
---
<BaseLayout title="About Avian World" description="Learn about Avian World, an independent English-language bird encyclopedia and publication platform.">
  <section class="about-hero container"><span class="eyebrow">OUR LITTLE CORNER OF THE NATURAL WORLD</span><h1>For the love of <em>birds.</em></h1>
    <p class="about-lead">Avian World is an independent bird encyclopedia and journal built around one simple idea: the more we notice the natural world, the more connected we become to it.</p>
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1444464666168-49d633b86797?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85" alt="A bird resting among natural branches" />
  </section>
  <section class="container about-content"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHY WE’RE HERE</span><h2>Curiosity takes flight.</h2></div>
    <div class="prose"><p>From the smallest garden visitor to the great travellers crossing continents, birds have a remarkable way of making us pause. Their colours, calls, migrations and adaptations tell stories about the places we share.</p>
      <p>Avian World brings species profiles and accessible articles together in one place. Whether you are learning to identify your first bird or deepening a lifelong interest in ornithology, there is always something new to discover.</p>
      <p>The project is built with open-source tools and a simple editorial model: content is written in Markdown, validated before publication and generated into a fast static website.</p>
      <a class="button button-dark" href={withBase("/blog/")}>Read our stories <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>